{"id":"6b5d81e801f2a0b2","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-desc-coanalytic-set.md","title":"ZFC Desc Coanalytic Set","display":"df-zfc-desc-coanalytic-set — ZFC Desc Coanalytic Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-desc-coanalytic-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-desc-coanalytic-set","58-df-zfc-descriptive2-coanalytic-set"],"display":"df-zfc-desc-coanalytic-set — ZFC Desc Coanalytic Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-desc-coanalytic-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-desc-coanalytic-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-coanalytic-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-desc-coanalytic-set — ZFC Desc Coanalytic Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69fbb4b15888982f\" href=\"?note=69fbb4b15888982f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code\">58-df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (Polish space) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S\\)</span> (Polish presentation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"69fbb4b15888982f\" href=\"?note=69fbb4b15888982f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code\">58-df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N=\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal N=\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> with its standard complete Baire metric <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathcal N}\">\\(d_{\\mathcal N}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AnalyticPolish}_S(B,X,d,\\mathcal D)\">\\(\\mathrm{AnalyticPolish}_S(B,X,d,\\mathcal D)\\)</span> (analytic-subset predicate for a coded Polish space, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescCoanalyticSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescCoanalyticSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CoanalyticSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CoanalyticSet}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}in\\text{-}polish}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AnalyticPolish}_S(B,X,d,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S(X,d,\\mathcal D)\n\\land B\\subseteq X\n\\land\\exists C\\subseteq X\\times\\mathcal N\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in(X\\times\\mathcal N)\\setminus C\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall\\langle y,v\\rangle\\in X\\times\\mathcal N\\;\\bigl(\nd(x,y)+d_{\\mathcal N}(u,v)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to\\langle y,v\\rangle\\notin C\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land B=\\{x\\in X:\\exists u\\in\\mathcal N\\;(\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in C)\\}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}in\\text{-}polish}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AnalyticPolish}_S(B,X,d,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S(X,d,\\mathcal D)\n\\land B\\subseteq X\n\\land\\exists C\\subseteq X\\times\\mathcal N\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in(X\\times\\mathcal N)\\setminus C\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall\\langle y,v\\rangle\\in X\\times\\mathcal N\\;\\bigl(\nd(x,y)+d_{\\mathcal N}(u,v)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to\\langle y,v\\rangle\\notin C\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land B=\\{x\\in X:\\exists u\\in\\mathcal N\\;(\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in C)\\}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescCoanalyticSet}_S(A,X)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists d,\\mathcal D\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S(X,d,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{AnalyticPolish}_S(X\\setminus A,X,d,\\mathcal D)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescCoanalyticSet}_S(A,X)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists d,\\mathcal D\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S(X,d,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{AnalyticPolish}_S(X\\setminus A,X,d,\\mathcal D)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CoanalyticSet}_S(A,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcDescCoanalyticSet}_S(A,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CoanalyticSet}_S(A,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcDescCoanalyticSet}_S(A,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Analyticity on an arbitrary coded Polish space is expanded as projection of a closed subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times\\omega^\\omega\">\\(X\\times\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>. The former call to the unary Euclidean-space predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Analytic}\">\\(\\operatorname{Analytic}\\)</span> with two arguments was ill-typed.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-coanalytic-set</code> is merged here; it used the same analytic-complement condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code","status":"resolved","id":"69fbb4b15888982f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code","status":"resolved","id":"69fbb4b15888982f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S$ (Polish presentation predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N=\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"d_{\\mathcal N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AnalyticPolish}_S(B,X,d,\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescCoanalyticSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CoanalyticSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}in\\text{-}polish}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AnalyticPolish}_S(B,X,d,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S(X,d,\\mathcal D)\n\\land B\\subseteq X\n\\land\\exists C\\subseteq X\\times\\mathcal N\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\qquad\\forall\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in(X\\times\\mathcal N)\\setminus C\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\forall\\langle y,v\\rangle\\in X\\times\\mathcal N\\;\\bigl(\nd(x,y)+d_{\\mathcal N}(u,v)<\\varepsilon\\to\\langle y,v\\rangle\\notin C\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land B=\\{x\\in X:\\exists u\\in\\mathcal N\\;(\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in C)\\}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescCoanalyticSet}_S(A,X)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists d,\\mathcal D\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S(X,d,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{AnalyticPolish}_S(X\\setminus A,X,d,\\mathcal D)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2CoanalyticSet}_S(A,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcDescCoanalyticSet}_S(A,X)","display":true},{"tex":"X\\times\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Analytic}","display":false}],"bytes":2405,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1795","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-desc-coanalytic-set.md|58-df-zfc-desc-coanalytic-set]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","69fbb4b15888982f"]}